SUMMARY:Mike Hellman & the Banned Books at the Penngrove Pub
DESCRIPTION:Mike Hellman is a country and americana troubadour with a bent for the unconventional. Slinging songs with substance\, conviction and grit\, he’s on a mission to tell his truth and he insists on being heard. While firmly rooted in the rich country and blues traditions of his home state of Texas\, he refuses to pander to cliché and his sound is anything but predictable. His lively performances swing from ballad to barn burner to outright rock ‘n’ roll\, and his rich baritone conjures earnestness and humor while dealing head-on with all aspects of the human condition (and with a not-so-subtle nod to the downtrodden). An “outlaw” for outlaws\, Mike’s music transcends the often narrow boundaries set by the mainstream country music establishment.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/mike-hellman-the-banned-books-at-the-penngrove-pub/
LOCATION:Penngrove Pub\, 10005 Main Street\, Penngrove\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.297140;-122.666400
