SUMMARY:Celebrate Mom Brunch
DESCRIPTION:Take your mother out for the Celebrate Mom Brunch on Saturday\, May 9\, at the Penngrove Community Clubhouse\, 385 Woodward Ave. in Penngrove. Hours are 9:30 – 11:30 am. \nEnjoy homemade muffins\, breads\, eggs\, bacon\, sausage\, coffee\, juice\, and a yogurt bar with fresh fruit\, plus a complimentary Mimosa. \nAdult tickets are $25. $10 for children ages 5 to 12. Purchase tickets in advance (not at the door) from Kim Hanson at 707 391-2191 or mrsjjava@hotmail.com or online at Eventbrite: PSFBrunch.eventbrite.com \nPenngrove Social Firemen is a nonprofit 501 c 3. They own and maintain the Penngrove clubhouse and park for the community’s enjoyment\, and they support community needs.
