SUMMARY:Generations in Motion Walk & Picnic: Fundraiser to Support Council on Aging
DESCRIPTION:FREE Registration ~ Generations in Motion Walk and Picnic\, May 9\, 2026\, at Spring Lake \n📢 Register today and help make an impact! \nhttps://raceroster.com/events/2026/115128/generations-in-motion-walk-and-picnic-2026 \nMovement is medicine. 👟💕 \nCome get your walk on and connect with a community that loves to have fun\, all while supporting seniors at our 2nd Annual Generations in Motion Walk & Picnic. \nThis is a family-friendly event benefiting Council on Aging Services for Seniors\, happening Saturday\, May 9\, 2026\, at Spring Lake in Santa Rosa. \nThis event is designed to connect families and all generations\, creating a fun and inclusive experience for everyone. Leashed pets are also welcome! 🐾 \nDetails: \nCheck-in begins at 10:00 AM\, with the walk starting at 11:30 AM. \n🌿 Scenic walking routes for all fitness levels and abilities\n💙 Community resource fair with local nonprofits\n👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family-friendly activities including games & bubbles for the kids\n🥗 Enjoy a picnic lunch from Drip Sandwiches available for purchase—or bring your own!\n🎟️ FREE registration fees make it easy to participate\n💰 Set up your own fundraising page to invite friends\, family & colleagues to support local seniors! \nLet’s unite to strengthen our community and support seniors in need! \nAnd this year Drip Sandwiches will be selling their delicious food! Available to purchase upon registration. Lunch must be purchased beforehand. Please purchase before May 4\, 2026 to secure your meal! You are also welcome to bring your own lunch. \n20% of proceeds from Drip Sandwiches will support Council on Aging. \nPricing:\nAdult: $25\nChild: $15\nMenu:\nGrilled Chicken Salad Sandwich\nRoasted Beef and Cheddar Sandwich\nSmoked Beet Egg Salad\nPasta Salad\nCookies\nVarious chips and drinks will be provided as well \nPlease note** Parking is $8 for Spring Lake Regional \nHope to see you there!!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/generations-in-motion-walk-picnic-fundraiser-to-support-council-on-aging/
LOCATION:Spring Lake Regional Park\, 393 Violetti Rd\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Other,Recreation
GEO:38.4542;-122.649
