SUMMARY:Eco-Friendly Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:Back for its 16th year! With over 25 gardens on the tour\, there are many amazing gardens to see. \nNo matter your gardening experience\, this tour is a perfect way to spend your Saturday! You’ll visit beautiful\, sustainable landscapes to inspire your own gardening ideas. \nWhy Attend? \nLearn more about eco-friendly gardening practices.\nGet inspired by local\, sustainable garden designs.\nConnect with like-minded gardeners\, landscapers\, and experts!\nSupport local businesses and non-profits. \nIn addition to having beautiful gardens on display\, many stops on the tour will have educational tables\, plant/seed giveaways\, demonstrations\, and more! This year’s Eco-Friendly Garden Tour is sure to be a vibrant celebration of sustainable gardening practices and communities! You won’t want to miss it. \nAfter registering\, we will send out garden locations and event details on April 17th\, allowing you to plan ahead for your self-guided tour. \nFree; registration required.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/eco-friendly-garden-tour/
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Eco-Friendly-Garden-Tour-1s.jpg
END:VEVENT
