SUMMARY:Visit Petaluma Open House with live music
DESCRIPTION:Whether you’re a visitor or a longtime resident\, stop in and learn something new about Petaluma! In addition to a wealth of information\, a peek at a 1914 Train Depot\, brochures\, and knowledgeable staff\, on May 9\, you’ll be treated to free samples of Petaluma goodness.\nLagunitas will have a table with Hoppy Refresher and Grand Central will be pouring Ecuadorian Coffee. Staying true to Petaluma’s vibe\, we will also have art and music! Wonderstump will bring interactive art and Kevin Hutchinson (kevinhutchinsonmusic.com) will be playing Americana tunes. Enter to win door prizes\, too!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/visit-petaluma-open-house-with-live-music/
LOCATION:Petaluma Visitors Center\, 210 Lakeville St\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952-3129\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
