SUMMARY:French Garden Market
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, May 9\, 2026\n12-4 p.m. | 21 & Older Only\n$45 per person \nHeld just in time for Mother’s Day weekend\, Dry Creek Vineyard’s French Garden Market invites guests to step into the charm of the French countryside with a festive outdoor celebration in the heart of Dry Creek Valley. Visitors can browse a thoughtfully curated collection of local artisans offering handcrafted treasures — from chic clothing and jewelry to gourmet foods and home goods — perfect for spring gifting.\nGuests are invited to sip and savor the release of the winery’s newest vintages of Petite Zin Rosé and Sauvignon Blanc while enjoying live music by electric violinist Maya Victoria\, who brings a lively twist to modern pop favorites. The event also features Claudine\, the winery’s vintage Citroën mobile bar and centerpiece of the wine garden\, along with delicious bites from a local food pop-up. Attendees are encouraged to relax\, linger\, and make a day of it.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/french-garden-market/
LOCATION:Dry Creek Vineyard\, 3770 Lambert Bridge Road\, Healdsburg\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
GEO:38.65345;-122.92403
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Dry Creek Vineyard 3770 Lambert Bridge Road Healdsburg CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=3770 Lambert Bridge Road:geo:-122.92403,38.65345
END:VEVENT
