SUMMARY:Saturday Live Music at Spicy Vines feat. The Musers
DESCRIPTION:Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come together. \nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a tasting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from across the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new sounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \nThe Musers\nRooted in rich musical traditions and diverse acoustic styles\, The Musers blend powerful vocals\, intricate guitar work\, and lively rhythms into a genre-crossing\, high-spirited sound. \nDetails\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/saturday-live-music-at-spicy-vines-feat-the-musers/
