SUMMARY:Matt Bradford at Lagunitas
DESCRIPTION:Matt Bradford is a singer\, songwriter\, and multi-instrumentalist who has transitioned his career from the Los Angeles session scene to becoming a recognized figure in the Northern California music community. \nHe is widely known for his expertise in the dobro and lap steel guitar. His music is a blend of Americana\, southern rock\, folk\, and blues rock. He is noted for his use of slide guitar and custom-built lap steels\, creating a sound often compared to the atmospheric style of David Gilmour. \nBefore moving north\, he was an in-demand session musician in Los Angeles\, working at major studios like Sony and Universal.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/matt-bradford-at-lagunitas/
LOCATION:Lagunitas Petaluma Taproom\, 1280 N McDowell Blvd.\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
